  {
   "id": 639849,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/6280217f48d09368.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work from APS Press)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n",
   "stem_html": "<p>Triadimenol is a fungicide used in agriculture. The graph shows the resistance of a type of fungus to this chemical over time. Each line in the graph represents data from a different year.</p>\n<p>Describe the pattern seen here.</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1246914,
     "content_html": "The fungus population did not change over time."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246915,
     "content_html": "The fungus developed resistance to the fungicide over time due to directional selection."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246913,
     "content_html": "The fungus becme more susceptible to the fungicide over time due to stabilizing selection."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246912,
     "content_html": "The fungus became more susceptible to the fungicide over time due to unknown reasons."
    }
   ],
